# Patient Naturalist: "mill three cards. Put a land card from among the milled cards into your hand. If you can't, create a Treasure token."
# Exactly three are milled (Forest, Memnite, Memnite; the Island fourth from the top stays in the library, so it is not milled). The one land
# card among them is not optional: it is the only choice and goes into Bot1's hand, no Treasure is made, and the Memnites stay in the
# graveyard, and Bot2's hand (seven Islands) is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Patient Naturalist
Memnite
Memnite
Memnite
Forest
Memnite
Memnite
Island
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Patient Naturalist.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Library.Top = Island

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Memnite; Memnite; Memnite
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Memnite
